<view class="page export-page"><view class="title">完整资料导出</view><view wx:if="{{status}}" class="section note">{{status}}</view><view class="section note">完整导出已包含，不额外收费。客服核验本人和范围后交付原声、原始转录、确认稿、照片、可交付 PDF 及可独立阅读的清单。</view><block wx:if="{{context}}"><view class="section card">申请期限：{{context.requestWindow.expiresAt || '交付后按原订单起算'}}<view>核验本人及范围后 {{context.service.within}} 个工作日内处理。实际处理人及截止时间随工单显示。</view></view><view wx:if="{{context.canRequest}}" class="section card"><view class="section-title">本次接收人</view><button class="btn secondary section" data-value="self" bindtap="recipient" disabled="{{busy}}">{{recipientChoice === 'self' ? '已选：' : ''}}由我本人领取</button><button class="btn secondary section" data-value="initiator" bindtap="recipient" disabled="{{busy}}">{{recipientChoice === 'initiator' ? '已选：' : ''}}明确授权发起人领取本次完整资料</button><view class="note section">共享故事和付款不会自动授予导出权。没有个人微信的讲述者可由客服核验本人和接收渠道，不能默认交给发起人。</view><label class="section">本次申请说明<textarea value="{{evidenceText}}" bindinput="evidence" maxlength="160" disabled="{{busy}}" /></label><button class="btn secondary section" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}">{{checked ? '已确认：' : '确认：'}}这是讲述者本人的完整资料导出申请</button><button class="btn section" bindtap="request" disabled="{{busy}}">提交申请，等待客服核验</button></view><view wx:else="" class="section note">当前账号不能提交本人导出申请，或申请资格已到期。可领取本人明确授权、仍在下载期内的既有资料包。</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="section card"><view class="section-title">{{item.label}}</view><view>工单：{{item.id}}</view><view>申请：{{item.requestedAt}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.ownerId}}">处理人：{{item.ownerId}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.dueAt}}">处理截止：{{item.dueAt}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.missingReason}}">缺失或待处理原因：{{item.missingReason}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.expiresAt}}">包下载截止：{{item.expiresAt}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.sha256}}" class="hash">ZIP SHA256：{{item.sha256}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.canDownload}}" class="btn section" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="download" disabled="{{busy}}">下载并保存完整 ZIP</button></view></block><button class="btn secondary section" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">重新查询</button><view class="section note">包到期只清理资料包，原始资料按各自保留期限处理。重试和重复领取不延长原期限；撤回不能收回已传输文件或纸书。当前仍为隔离合成验证，实际政策及渠道待核验。</view></view>
